<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ lang_tag() }}">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SFPHP</title>

    <!-- SFCSS, served from your own public/assets: no CDN, no web font. -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/sfcss.min.css') }}">
</head>
<body class="bg-light">

<main class="container py-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4">

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">SFPHP</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-8">
        It works. This page is <code>resources/views/welcome.sfht</code> — yours
        to replace.
    </p>

    <div class="card mb-6">
        <div class="card-header"><strong>Where things are</strong></div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <table class="w-full text-sm">
                <tr>
                    <td class="py-2"><code>routes.php</code></td>
                    <td class="py-2 text-muted">Your routes</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="py-2"><code>app/Controllers/</code></td>
                    <td class="py-2 text-muted">Your controllers</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="py-2"><code>resources/views/</code></td>
                    <td class="py-2 text-muted">Your templates</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="py-2"><code>public/index.php</code></td>
                    <td class="py-2 text-muted">The front controller</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="py-2"><code>.env</code></td>
                    <td class="py-2 text-muted">Optional — everything has a default</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card mb-8">
        <div class="card-header"><strong>Next</strong></div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <pre><code>./vendor/bin/sfphp make:controller Post
./vendor/bin/sfphp make:migration:create posts
./vendor/bin/sfphp migrate
./vendor/bin/sfphp routes</code></pre>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-4 mb-0">
                <code>./vendor/bin/sfphp</code> on its own lists all 35 commands.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
        <a class="btn btn-primary"
           href="https://github.com/fabioaacarneiro/sfphp-project/blob/master/docs/en/DOCUMENTATION.md">Documentation</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary"
           href="https://github.com/fabioaacarneiro/sfphp-project">GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-8 mb-0">
        Zero runtime dependencies. Documentation in
        <a href="https://github.com/fabioaacarneiro/sfphp-project/blob/master/docs/en/DOCUMENTATION.md">English</a>,
        <a href="https://github.com/fabioaacarneiro/sfphp-project/blob/master/docs/pt-BR/DOCUMENTATION.md">português</a>
        and
        <a href="https://github.com/fabioaacarneiro/sfphp-project/blob/master/docs/es/DOCUMENTATION.md">español</a>.
    </p>

</main>

<script src="{{ asset('js/sfjs.min.js') }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
